            "fallback_width": 1333,
            "fallback_height": 2000,
            "heading": "Liv",
            "subheading": "",
            "body": "<p>Hiya I'm Liv, and I started hairdressing at 15. Hairdressing has always been a big interest of mine, and I've loved growing my skills, meeting new people and finding my own style along the way.</p><p>What I love most about hairdressing is the people. I love the one-on-one experience with my clients, getting to know them, having a chat and making them feel their absolute best. There's nothing better than seeing someone walk out of the salon feeling like a whole new woman — with I'm Every Woman by Chaka Khan playing in the background! I also absolutely love the atmosphere in our salon. Working alongside my team feels like working with a second family, and the laughs, chats and good vibes make coming to work feel like I've never actually worked a day in my life!</p><p>I'm really proud to have qualified as a hairdresser and to have built my skills and experience from such a young age. I'm excited to keep learning, creating and, most importantly, making people feel amazing one head of hair at a time.</p>",
            "link_label": "Get in touch",
            "link_url": "/pages/contact"
          }
        },
        "person_2": {
          "type": "person",
          "settings": {
            "image": "",
            "image_alt": "Lilly Wills, hairdresser at Silk Hair Lab",
            "fallback_asset": "silk-team-lily.jpg",
            "fallback_width": 1333,
            "fallback_height": 2000,
            "heading": "Lilly",
            "subheading": "",
            "body": "<p>Hi I'm Lilly Wills, I started my apprenticeship in my last year of school, graduating last year I've loved growing my skills and confidence in the industry ever since. What I love most about the hairdressing industry is being able to meet different people and make them feel confident and happy with their hair. I love doing hair because it allows me to be creative while also making someone feel their best. One of my achievements so far has been building my confidence and skills through my apprenticeship and being able to take on more services and responsibilities as I've progressed.</p><p>I'm excited to keep learning and growing.</p><p>I'm now entering the world of trichology and as a qualified scalp practitioner will be extending my services and knowledge further to support our clients in the Hair Lab.</p>",
            "link_label": "Get in touch",
            "link_url": "/pages/contact"
          }
        },
        "person_3": {
          "type": "person",
          "settings": {
