            "image_alt": "Makenna Bates, hairdresser at Silk Hair Lab",
            "fallback_asset": "silk-team-makenna.jpg",
            "fallback_width": 1333,
            "fallback_height": 2000,
            "heading": "Makenna",
            "subheading": "",
            "body": "<p>Hi, I'm Makenna Bates. I've been hairdressing since I was 15 and have always loved the creative side of the industry. As an emerging stylist, I'm passionate about continuing to learn, build my experience and become the best stylist I can be.</p><p>What I love about hairdressing is that there's always something new to learn and so many different ways to be creative. I enjoy being able to bring someone's vision to life and create a look that makes them feel confident.</p><p>I also love the relationships you build with clients and the atmosphere of working in a salon. Being able to make someone feel comfortable, have a good chat and leave feeling happy with their hair is one of my favourite parts of the job. I'm excited to keep developing my skills and growing within the industry.</p>",
